 a role in normal retinal development (By similarity). Plays a role in cell migration (PubMed:30258100)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}